{
  "id": 8833353515207,
  "title": "Custom Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Set with Colorful Mosaic Sunburst",
  "handle": "custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-bedding-019f2b38a4-019f2b38a4",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty and serene energy of nature with the custom Tree of Life bedding set by Jeminise. This beautifully designed quilt set showcases a vibrant Yggdrasil pattern, bringing a touch of Celtic tradition and farmhouse charm to any bedroom decor. Crafted for versatile comfort, it offers lightweight warmth during warm summer nights and cozy, breathable layers for chilly winter seasons.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Fully customizable background, framing colors, and text squares to feature your own sayings, pet names, or loved ones' names.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Made from 100% soft polyester with high-quality silk floss filling for breathable, durable, and long-lasting comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling, keeping its vibrant colors and softness wash after wash.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, backyard picnic mat, or camping companion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Features one premium quilt with optional matching pillowcases to complete your customized set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Tree of Life-ds13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
